# rewrite/.gitignore - rewrite-local ignore rules.
#
# Dual licensed under AGPL-3.0-only OR Apache-2.0.

# The mdBook sources live in docs/book; the repo-root `book/`
# pattern (meant for mdBook output) would swallow them.
!docs/book/
# The generated mdBook output inside it stays ignored.
docs/book/book/
# Cargo build output for the rewrite workspace.
/.target/

# Nix build outputs.
result
result-*
